    viogpu3d: F97 fixed resolutions (1080p, 1440p, Fold screens, 4K) + viogpuap fixed-size switch [skip ci]
    
    - Mode list gains 1920x1080, 2560x1440, the Fold's inner (2448x1848) and
      cover (1248x1972) screens in both orientations, and 3840x2160, next to
      the host window size (custom slot) - all in 60 and 120 Hz (F96).
    - viogpuap (source now in this repo, as built for the Fold): while
      C:\Users\Public\viogpu-vast exists (clipsync "Resolutie" with a fixed
      size) the host window size is not followed; it polls every 2 s so
      "Automatisch" follows the window again at once.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

